 bbell press 3–4 x 8–10\nSuperset: chest-supported row 3 x 8–10 + lat
 eral raise 3 x 10–15\nTriceps pushdown 2 x 10–12\n\nJumps: none this w
 eek (intro week).\n\nIntro week — keep the same weight as planned. Cut y
 our sets to 50% of normal. No jumps.
